WEBVTT

00:02:29.854 --> 00:02:33.900
exploitation of women and girls
thrives as ever before.

00:02:35.610 --> 00:02:37.653
From where does this toxicity come

00:02:37.653 --> 00:02:38.654
and why?

00:02:38.821 --> 00:02:41.199
Men are not endangered,

00:02:41.199 --> 00:02:42.950
we’re not under assault,

00:02:42.950 --> 00:02:44.619
we’re not being unfairly maligned.

00:02:45.203 --> 00:02:49.332
In fact, it’s men, or certain types of
masculinity, that are the issue.

00:02:51.292 --> 00:02:53.294
To be clear,

00:02:53.294 --> 00:02:56.214
being a man does not make me

00:02:56.214 --> 00:02:58.049
or anyone else who identifies as a man

00:02:58.049 --> 00:02:59.091
inherently toxic.